{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/50da8a3ecf775ef98bc627ac676566d1.poster.avif?t=1769204917\" width=1170 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/50da8a3ecf775ef98bc627ac676566d1.webm?t=1769204917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/50da8a3ecf775ef98bc627ac676566d1.mp4?t=1769204917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>PUNCH ARENA</strong> ! There are no guns here \u2014 only <strong>elastic punches!</strong> <br>This is a colorful and fun <strong>brawler</strong> <strong>battle royale</strong> full of action and laughter. <br>The art style is bright and cheerful, and the matches are fast and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player starts the game <strong>with equal conditions</strong>. Before each match, you can use your starting points to choose and upgrade <strong>skills</strong> that fit your play style. The points you earn during the match return to you at the end \u2014 <strong>use them to improve your skills and start the next round stronger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every round is a new experience.</strong> Random map layouts, changing game modes, surprise modifiers, and your own skill choices make each match unique. Fast matches, quick learning, and that \u201cone more round\u201d feeling \u2014 play alone or with friends; every round brings new chaos and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/10ef71dd72de1b457cbf1d1f68a38c55.poster.avif?t=1769204917\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/10ef71dd72de1b457cbf1d1f68a38c55.webm?t=1769204917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/10ef71dd72de1b457cbf1d1f68a38c55.mp4?t=1769204917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your punches, your weapons:</strong> Stretch, hit, and combo your way to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party-style art:</strong> Bright, colorful, and fun graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equal start, custom builds:</strong> Everyone starts equal; upgrades make the difference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every round feels different:</strong> Random maps, modifiers, and skill builds make each match fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and upgrade:</strong> Earn points, level up skills, and get stronger every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and replayable:</strong> Quick matches that keep you coming back for more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0e3f6780116623faa05b15465b0ffe93.poster.avif?t=1769204917\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0e3f6780116623faa05b15465b0ffe93.webm?t=1769204917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0e3f6780116623faa05b15465b0ffe93.mp4?t=1769204917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill List</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit Power</strong> \u2014 Increases punch damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arm Length</strong> \u2014 Extends punch reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punch Speed</strong> \u2014 Makes your punches faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Speed</strong> \u2014 Increases movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump Height</strong> \u2014 Makes you jump higher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash</strong>\u00a0<strong>Length</strong> \u2014 Increases dash distance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash Cooldown</strong>\u00a0\u2014\u00a0Reduces the cooldown between dashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Max Health\u00a0</strong>\u2014\u00a0Increases maximum health.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0bfad5a7f2bc50c55312f4eb354d1462.poster.avif?t=1769204917\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0bfad5a7f2bc50c55312f4eb354d1462.webm?t=1769204917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/extras/0bfad5a7f2bc50c55312f4eb354d1462.mp4?t=1769204917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098770?t=1769204917","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/44feba4248a53dbabc80b73180a68e2d3685b683/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769204917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098770/b23627c1204235f1eeba8d3a9f007f655ac1ea21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769204917","capsule_imagev5":"https://share